      "text": "Post metadata table:\n(post_id, user_id, caption, media_urls (list of s3 urls), status: UPLOADING / UPLOADED)\n\nFollower table:\n(follower_id, followee_id)\nPartition on follower_id\nUse Global secondary index on followee_id",
